  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in the tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent and starting to brown.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb cubes and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the coriander powder, cumin powder, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add 1 cup of water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Stir in the fresh oregano and continue to simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Serve the curry hot, garnished with additional oregano if desired."
